{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2023-05-08 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ASSET ACQUISITION OF BROWNLEE AGENCY, INC.', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., MAY 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND CASEY C. BROWNLEE, JOHN R. BROWNLEE AND DAVID Z. MONK, THE SHAREHOLDERS OF BROWNLEE AGENCY, INC., TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A SUBSIDIARY OF BROWN & BROWN, INC., HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF BROWNLEE AGENCY.'}